{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262kyRFAyKF01794612862.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英國巴克萊銀行集團繼上月宣布裁員約5,000人後，據報將於下星期再裁減約200個職位。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，巴克萊最快將於下星期二開始新的裁員行動，將涉及不同資歷層級員工，主要影響倫敦及紐約部門職位。報道引述知情人士稱，新一輪裁員是提升營運效率計劃的一部分，會把更多資源投入優先發展的業務及人才。巴克萊對消息不予置評。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.258865+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T22:38:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T01:10:34.327213+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T00:50:23.251675+00:00","content_hash":"2eb7cb37fee13a90b1465ba8fe27400fb6fea3e79ba973d154b611f064458eb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-14T00:57:08.258865+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}